OL,3,GNEWSCCulture Secretary says "jury's    
OL,4,Cout" on Ofcom's ability to deliver     
OL,5,Conline safety role                     
OL,7,FFollowing the passage of the Online    
OL,8,FSafety Act, Ofcom is responsible for   
OL,9,Fenforcing standards on social media,   
OL,10,Falongside its regulation of            
OL,11,Fbroadcasting.                          
OL,13,FNandy said the government was asking   
OL,14,Fthe regulator to do "an awful lot"     
OL,15,Facross both areas. She acknowledged    
OL,16,Fthat the government itself had to      
OL,17,Faccept some responsibility for not     
OL,18,Fhaving done enough.                    
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
