OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 145 Fri 27 NovC19:11/32
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/5 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCCulture Secretary says "jury's    
OL,4,Cout" on Ofcom's ability to deliver     
OL,5,Conline safety role                     
OL,7,FNandy took on responsibility for online
OL,8,Fsafety three months ago. She said she  
OL,9,Fdid not understand how those working in
OL,10,Fthe field "can sleep at night" knowing 
OL,11,Fthat harm was being caused now, with   
OL,12,Fmore families losing children as a     
OL,13,Fresult.                                
OL,15,FShe added that no one, including those 
OL,16,Fresponsible for enforcement, was       
OL,17,Ftreating the issue with the urgency it 
OL,18,Fdemanded.                              
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
