OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/5 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCCulture Secretary says "jury's    
OL,4,Cout" on Ofcom's ability to deliver     
OL,5,Conline safety role                     
OL,7,GOFCOM RESPONSE                         
OL,9,FAn Ofcom spokesperson said the         
OL,10,Fregulator took its online safety       
OL,11,Fresponsibilities "extremely seriously".
OL,12,FIt said it had investigated more than  
OL,13,F100 platforms and fined 11 companies,  
OL,14,Fwith further action to come.           
OL,16,FThe spokesperson added that Ofcom was  
OL,17,Fworking closely with the government to 
OL,18,Fprepare for the introduction of        
OL,19,Fstronger social media restrictions for 
OL,20,Fchildren next year.                    
OL,23,EPub: 25-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
